  "difficulty": "medium",
  "summary": "作者指出天同坐命的健康与外貌不能只凭福星定论，须看吉煞组合。古籍既有温润貌美之说，也有天同陀罗同宫、身命闲陷遇羊等负面描述，互相矛盾且记录不足；作者只把部分五行说当参考，并限定自身论述适用范围，不视为医学或族群外貌事实。",
  "summary_en": "The author rejects judging Tian Tong in the Life Palace solely as a fortunate star: health and appearance depend on benefic and malefic combinations. Classical sources alternate between favorable descriptions and adverse accounts involving Tuo Luo in the same palace or Qing Yang in weak Life/Body placements. The author questions these contradictions and incomplete records, treating some elemental explanations only as references and limiting their claimed applicability. These are attributed astrological views, not established medical or ethnic appearance facts.",
